00:05:31.322 --> 00:05:32.280
That's apparently not--

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:33.946
NORI HEIKKINEN: Do
you want me to just--

00:05:33.946 --> 00:05:35.665
DANIEL CIRULI: Yeah, please do.

00:05:35.665 --> 00:05:38.690
Oh, hey.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:42.050
[INAUDIBLE] You figure out
